# Craft weapons: Range used to be the most important stat, as it allowed you to intercept most UFOs with your starting Avalanches without any risk of taking damage.
# To get rid of this problem, UFOs all have the same range (65)
# As a result, all stats are equally important and help you take down UFOs faster, and by extension take less return fire.
# Most weapons were buffed to fit this new paradigm.
# Missiles are perfectly accurate, and way more expensive. Stingrays help down crafts quickly, while Avalanches are nukes; use sparingly.

# Basic cannon got a little buffed, but is mainly useful because it's much cheaper than missiles.
# Laser cannon ditto; infinite free ammo is a big deal now. Both fill the same, Get in close role.
# Plasma cannon requires manufactured ammo, and behaves more like the battlefield weapons than a laser. You will still probably spend more on fuel though.
# Fusion launchers are the only weapon that outrange UFOs, but are very hard to get.


craftWeapons:
  - type: STR_STINGRAY # Basically an old avalanche.
    range: 60 # 30
    damage: 100 # 70
    accuracy: 100 # 70 # Could probably cut this back to 70, and give it 6 ammo again. 
    ammoMax: 3 # 6
#    rearmRate: 1
    reloadCautious: 18 # 64
    reloadStandard: 18 # 48
    reloadAggressive: 18 # 32
    projectileSpeed: 30 # 8
    
  - type: STR_AVALANCHE
    range: 60 # 60
    damage: 400 # 100
    accuracy: 100 # 80 # Not 100% sure this is reasonable, but also, 300k per pop, so 100% seems fair.
    ammoMax: 2 # 3
#    rearmRate: 1
    reloadCautious: 24 # 96
    reloadStandard: 24 # 72
    reloadAggressive: 24 # 48
    projectileSpeed: 30 # 8
  - type: STR_CANNON_UC
    range: 20 # 10 # Seriously, was a piece of crap.
#    damage: 10
    accuracy: 33 # 25 # Even now, not the best weapon, but it downs even small scouts pretty safely.
#    ammoMax: 200
#    rearmRate: 100
    reloadCautious: 2 # 4
    reloadStandard: 2 # 4 
    reloadAggressive: 2 # 4
    projectileSpeed: 40 # 8
  - type: STR_LASER_CANNON_UC # Basically a t2 cannon.
    range: 30 # 21
    damage: 80 # 70 # I may want to cut dmg and boost ROF.
    accuracy: 80 # 35
#    ammoMax: 100
#    rearmRate: 50
    reloadCautious: 8 # 24
    reloadStandard: 8 # 24
    reloadAggressive: 8 # 24
  - type: STR_PLASMA_BEAM_UC
#    damage: 140
    range: 40 # 52
    accuracy: 70 # 50
    ammoMax: 50 # 100
    rearmRate: 10 # 50
#    reloadCautious: 24
#    reloadStandard: 24
#    reloadAggressive: 24
    
    clip: STR_PLASMA_BEAM_ROUNDS
  - type: STR_FUSION_BALL_UC
    range: 68 # 65
    ammoMax: 6 # 2
#    rearmRate: 1
    damage: 800 # 230
    reloadCautious: 12 # 64
    reloadStandard: 12 # 48
    reloadAggressive: 12 # 32
    projectileSpeed: 30 # 8
    
# Crafts: Lighting slightly buffed, but still not the best. But its available significantly before the firestorm. Firestorm is now the fastest craft, giving it a late-game role for intercepting Battleships etc.
# Skyranger and Intercepter Rent prices down to ~1/3rd. No longer do you buy a shiny new intercepter per month automatically, throwing the old one in the trash. Also, This goes into your missile fund.
# Avenger remains overall best.
